# Path-only rewrites (no query param needed) — recreates vercel.json's
# `rewrites` for these five clean URLs. Status 200 = proxy/rewrite (URL
# stays the same in the browser), matching Vercel's rewrite (not redirect)
# behavior. More specific routes must come before the general ones.
/products/:parentId/:variantSlug /product 200
/products/:slug /product 200
/category/* /category 200
/brand/* /brand 200
/blog/category/:slug /blog 200
/blog/:slug /blog-post 200
